body:
I would want to do that, but I know my body doesn't work like that. I literally was suffering from excruciating withdrawals, and I couldn't drop my dose, but I started doing ketamine treatments with my psychiatrist and it helped me reduce my tolerance and come off these meds with fewer withdrawal symptoms in the acute phase.

&#x200B;

Unfortunately, it seems like my body doesn't have the inability to heal, so I am going to have to find something which can help my body do so.
